    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Are the Next Victim</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in a strange locked room, you realize one thing: this house is a trap, and its owner is a maniac keeping you here for reasons only he knows. You have just <strong>a few days to escape</strong>, but every mistake brings you closer to your demise\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618080/extras/fb1f0aa5663eeb33fa6b5985afc91b2c.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618080/extras/fb1f0aa5663eeb33fa6b5985afc91b2c.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618080/extras/fb1f0aa5663eeb33fa6b5985afc91b2c.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADLY HIDE AND SEEK</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The killer <strong>hears every sound</strong>\u2014drop an item or step on a creaky floorboard, and he\u2019ll come hunting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay alert</strong>\u2014you can encounter him anywhere, and his traps are scattered throughout the house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t try to fight</strong>\u2014without proper preparation, you won\u2019t survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THREE WAYS TO ESCAPE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618080/extras/292ace02f4bb89872374c27dd206c88d.avif?t=1754648337\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent Escape</strong>: Unlock the front door and slip away unnoticed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loud Escape</strong>: Find a weapon and turn the tables on your captor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret Method</strong>: \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 <i>(Unlock to discover\u2026)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SECRET HE\u2019S HIDING</strong><br>You don\u2019t know why he took you. You don\u2019t even remember <i>how</i> or <i>when</i> it happened. But somewhere in this house\u2026 <strong>the truth is waiting</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light &amp; Shadow</strong>: The killer controls the lights too. If the power goes out, navigation becomes a nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles</strong>: Solve environmental riddles to progress\u2014each more twisted than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hideouts</strong>: Closets offer temporary safety, but <strong>you\u2019re never truly safe</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the secret\u2026 or become another victim of his madness?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why This Works:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery Hook</strong>: The redacted &quot;Secret Method&quot; and hidden motive create intrigue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear Stakes</strong>: &quot;A few days to escape&quot; raises urgency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Details</strong>: Light mechanics and traps add depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapts Russian Wordplay</strong>: &quot;\u041f\u043e\u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f\u0439\u0442\u0435\u0441\u044c \u0440\u043e\u043b\u044f\u043c\u0438&quot; \u2192 &quot;Turn the tables&quot; keeps the tone sharp.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Are the Next Victim</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in a strange locked room, you realize one thing: this house is a trap, and its owner is a maniac keeping you here for reasons only he knows. You have just <strong>a few days to escape</strong>, but every mistake brings you closer to your demise\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618080/extras/fb1f0aa5663eeb33fa6b5985afc91b2c.poster.avif?t=1754648337\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618080/extras/fb1f0aa5663eeb33fa6b5985afc91b2c.webm?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618080/extras/fb1f0aa5663eeb33fa6b5985afc91b2c.mp4?t=1754648337\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADLY HIDE AND SEEK</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The killer <strong>hears every sound</strong>\u2014drop an item or step on a creaky floorboard, and he\u2019ll come hunting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay alert</strong>\u2014you can encounter him anywhere, and his traps are scattered throughout the house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t try to fight</strong>\u2014without proper preparation, you won\u2019t survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THREE WAYS TO ESCAPE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618080/extras/292ace02f4bb89872374c27dd206c88d.avif?t=1754648337\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p clas